    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As your shot strikes, the spell makes a shower of thorns burst from your Ranged weapon or its ammunition. The target of the attack and every creature within 5 feet of it make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 1d10 Piercing damage on a failure or half as much damage on a success.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 1.</p>",
